# Shevelop Roku Channel

Shevelop is a digital media platform and Roku streaming channel focused on amplifying Black women and underrepresented voices in technology and STEM.

## Mission
To provide visibility, storytelling, and access to real career narratives in tech through long-form video conversations.

## Platform
- Roku Streaming Store
- Living-room-first distribution
- No paywall at launch

## Audience
- Women in STEM
- Black and underrepresented technologists
- Students, career-switchers, and early professionals

## Content Format
- Video podcast episodes
- Guest-led conversations
- Career, innovation, and leadership focus

## Growth Strategy
- Roku distribution
- Community partnerships
- Sponsorship-ready infrastructure
- Future expansion to educational content

## Status
Channel in active development. Initial public launch planned following Season 1 completion.

